The 2024–25 season was the 109th season in the history of [[RCD Mallorca|Real Club Deportivo Mallorca]], and the club's fourth consecutive season in [[La Liga]]. In addition to the [[2024–25 La Liga|domestic league]], the club participated in the [[2024–25 Copa del Rey|Copa del Rey]] and the [[2025 Supercopa de España|Supercopa de España]].

On 10 June 2024, [[Jagoba Arrasate]] was announced as the team's manager for three seasons.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.besoccer.com/new/official-jagoba-arrasate-becomes-mallorca-s-new-coach-1319092|title=OFFICIAL: Jagoba Arrasate becomes Mallorca's new coach|website=www.besoccer.com}}</ref>

